{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは〜もうこんばんはだ！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "藤嶌果歩(20)です🐑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は日が落ちるのがとっても遅いのでずっとこんにちはの気分です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日が落ちるのが遅い分、朝方に日が昇っていくのを見るのは早いです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "中々寝付けず外が明るくなって来た時"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずーーんって気持ちになります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かほりんが寝れない日なんてあるの！？"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "と思ったそこの方！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かほりんも寝れない日があります。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前日にとんでもなく寝た日とかね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こうして大人になってくのかな"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "20歳、正直まだまだ寝てます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobWRcFgi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobjjav9r.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ジャケ写撮影の時の写真です！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんな水色の服着ててかわいいんだ♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobfT9CMc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "足先まで水色です🩵"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobPG8xDq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回はTYPE-Cに"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さくらぶりーとまなみんと一緒に登場しております！優しく見守る先輩感を出してみました！初めてのキャラ✨✨"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふたりが喋ってる姿を眺めるのが好きなんだ〜"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心温まるよね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobjt5UDx.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とっても可愛い写真撮らせてもらっちゃった！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どちらかが傘を持つのではなく、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふたりで持つ姿。これぞまなさく。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして肩をぎゅっと握る大野氏、、写真になると急接近しがちなんだよね"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一方、らぶりっちは特に先輩だと若干距離を開けがち。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これがまなさく。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな尊い2人との撮影、嬉しかったです🥰"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobtjvX6F.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほら！幸せそう！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミーグリの二次受付が開始しました！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ会いに来てくださると嬉しいです😻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "〈 日程 〉"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年10月4日（日）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年10月11日（日）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年10月18日（日）"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "パジャマミーグリしようかなぁ💤"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年10月25日（日）"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハロウィンするよ🎃今年は何かな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年11月1日（日）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年12月6日（日）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一部は〇〇さんおはよ〜の"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "挨拶キャンペーンをしています！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいい服着たり、大人っぽい服着てみたりしてるのでぜひ会いに来てね🤍ハロウィンも楽しみ！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobSKOAxu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前回の京都リアミオフショット👘 ♡"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミーグリは季節感じられて良いよね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobnj0lVc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobkaR2tn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "^^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobaoxWkc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "んちょ、参戦‼️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あなたの毎日のQOLを"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かほりんミーグリで上げてみせます⬆️⬆️✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "↓↓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://fortunemusic.jp/hinatazaka_202609/"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは今日はこの辺で〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この前、みっちゃんと唐揚げパーティーしたんだ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前にみっちゃんがお家で作った唐揚げが食べたいなぁってボヤいてたのを思い出して誘ったんだ🎶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めてお家で揚げ物したんだけど、油が怖くて絶叫しながら二人で揚げたよ😌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "揚げ物を習得できて楽しいクッキングでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "水曜日もお疲れ様です🐑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "藤嶌果歩"}], "source": "official"}